    "title": "Lesson 45: The Spread Operator (...) for Arrays and Objects: Shallow Cloning & Merging",
    "slug": "js-lesson-45-the-spread-operator-for-arrays-and-objects-shallow-cloning-merging",
    "category": "programming",
